  "faqs": {
    "items": [
      {
        "q": "How do I book an appointment?",
        "a": "Find a salon from Home or Explore, choose your services, a stylist (or Any Stylist) and a time, then tap Confirm Booking."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is Cutit Go?",
        "a": "Cutit Go brings a barber, hairstylist or makeup artist to your home or event. Pick the professional, services, address and time — the travel fee is shown before you confirm."
      },
      {
        "q": "Why is my booking \"Pending\"?",
        "a": "The salon or stylist hasn't accepted it yet. It changes to Confirmed as soon as they do."
      },
      {
        "q": "How do I cancel or reschedule?",
        "a": "Open the booking in Bookings, tap \"Need Help with this Booking?\", then choose Cancel Booking or Reschedule Booking."
      },
      {
        "q": "How can I pay?",
        "a": "Pay in cash at your appointment, by card, or from your Cutit Wallet. Set your preferred method in Profile → Default payment."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is there an extra fee for at-home services?",
        "a": "Yes. Cutit Go bookings include a travel fee based on your area, shown on its own line before you confirm."
      },
      {
        "q": "What if my stylist is late or doesn't show up?",
        "a": "Report it from Profile → Report a booking issue, and our team will follow up with you."
      },
      {
        "q": "How do I leave a review?",
        "a": "After your visit is completed, go to Bookings → Past and tap Leave a Review. Add a rating, and a comment or photos if you like."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I book without an account?",
        "a": "Yes. You can browse and set up a booking as a guest; when you confirm, we verify your phone number and create your account."
      },
      {
        "q": "How do I change the language?",
        "a": "Go to Profile → Language. The app restarts to switch between English and Arabic."
      }
    ],
    "stillNeedHelp": "Still need help?"
  },
